export const integrationQuestion='When combining two companies, how should I decide which overlapping roles and managers to retain when department heads may be biased toward protecting their own teams or preferred employees? What objective criteria should I use, and how should I evaluate whether the eventual gains in quality, efficiency, margins and profitability justify the restructuring costs, management distraction, employee turnover, systems integration and time required to realize synergies? If the integration takes a year or more and produces only a 20% improvement, how do I determine whether it was economically worthwhile?';
